    "title": "Rendon's hat trick paces Dwight-Morrow over Ridgefield Park - Girls soccer recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reed Becker ,\n45 minutes ago Isabella Rendon recorded a hat trick in Dwight-Morrow’s 4-1 victory over Ridgefield Park in Englewood. Dwight-Morrow led 1-0 at the break before outscoring Ridgefield Park 3-1 in the second half. Anelle Avallone added a goal and two assists, while Donna Albarracin finished with eight saves. Dwight-Morrow (7-4) will visit... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
